OL,3,GNEWSAThree officers injured after lorry
OL,4,Acrashes into police vehicle
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree police officers have been injured
OL,7,Fin County Down after a lorry they were
OL,8,Fpursuing drove on the wrong side of the
OL,9,Froad and collided with their vehicle at
OL,10,Fspeed.
OL,12,FA 36-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of driving while unfit
OL,14,Fthrough drink or drugs, driving while
OL,15,Fdisqualified and dangerous driving.
OL,17,FA police vehicle was extensively
OL,18,Fdamaged but the officers injuries are
OL,19,Fthought not to be serious at this time.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
