OL,3,GNEWSAThree officers injured after lorry
OL,4,Acrashes into police vehicle
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe incident began following a report
OL,7,Fof a blue articulated lorry swerving on
OL,8,FMoygannon Road in the Warrenpoint area
OL,9,Fshortly before 23:30 BST on Saturday.
